                            <comment id="15256479" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 25 Apr 2016 15:28:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There is a `org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.version.GridCacheVersion` object in the lockId field.&lt;br/&gt;
It is being written using optimized marshaller (due to BinaryClassDescriptor.useOptimizedMarshaller flag) and can&apos;t be read on .NET side.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
